    "english": {
      "headingRaw": "Five-character-regular-verseLiBaiAMESSAGETOMENGHAORAN",
      "translationRaw": "Master，Ihailyoufrommyheart，Andyourfamearisentotheskies。。。。Renouncinginruddyyouththeimportanceofhatandchariot，Youchosepine-treesandclouds；andnow，whitehaired，Drunkwiththemoon，asageofdreams，Flower-bewitched，youaredeaftotheEmperor。。。。Highmountain，howIlongtoreachyou，Breathingyoursweetnessevenhere！",
      "translationClean": "Master, Ihailyoufrommyheart, Andyourfamearisentotheskies.... Renouncinginruddyyouththeimportanceofhatandchariot, Youchosepine-treesandclouds; andnow, whitehaired, Drunkwiththemoon, asageofdreams, Flower-bewitched, youaredeaftotheEmperor.... Highmountain, howIlongtoreachyou, Breathingyoursweetnessevenhere!",
